    "catalog:tags": "urinal, wall-hung, washroom",
    "catalog:note": "Wall-hung urinal in format v2: a back panel; a half-round bowl 0.35 deep from the wall, its wall a U of true arcs (an outline sweep) from the bottom to the rim, round a floor 0.05 thick (an outline sweep of the inner half-round) set 0.015 into it (overlap bowlWall+floor); and above it a hood of two cheeks and a top, stepped back to 0.175 from the wall. bottom 0.35, rim 0.60. The hood is stepped, not sloped.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "0.35 x 0.35 x 0.65, bottom 0.35 and rim 0.60 are generic practice sizes, not checked against a published source (unverified). Port sizes from the drafting standard (BS EN 12056-2 conventions), unverified",
